### 20. 댓글 목록 조회 - 방금 단 댓글/대댓글 포함
GET {{host}}/posts/{{postId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

> {%
client.test("댓글 목록에 2개 이상 포함", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "expected 200, got " + response.status);
    const ids = response.body.data.map(function (c) { return c.id; });
    client.assert(ids.indexOf("{{commentId}}") !== -1, "top comment should be present");
    client.assert(ids.indexOf("{{replyId}}") !== -1, "reply should be present");
});
%}

